Full-duplex low-latency endpoint for streaming video frames.

On Connect: Server sends a handshake payload acknowledging session creation:

JSON
{
  "type": "handshake",
  "session_id": "e4b2d189-3221-4f9e-a89c-8a623f2f0122",
  "message": "Session initialized successfully"
}
Client Frame Payload: Send base64-encoded JPEG frame string:

JSON
{
  "frame": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQABAAD..."
}
Server Response: Returns detection state and annotated base64 frame:

JSON
{
  "session_id": "e4b2d189-3221-4f9e-a89c-8a623f2f0122",
  "frame": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQABAAD...",
  "ear": 0.19,
  "mar": 2.15,
  "drowsy": true,
  "yawning": true,
  "sleeping": false,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-12T13:30:01"
}
